id: pm-csv-compat-177
title: Preserve CSV refusal and full-row evidence on pm-cli 2026.10.20
description: "Diagnose Dependabot PR 177 failures against pm-cli 2026.10.15 and 2026.10.20; preserve pre-mutation journal refusal, complete CSV reads and partial-import error guarantees. Verify npm and Bun release gates and assess upstream lease fencing without changing dependency pins."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[2]: compatibility,"gh:unbraind/pm-csv#177"
created_at: "2026-10-23T11:07:27.965Z"
